{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:39:54Z","created_by_operation":"op_14b2533f5f5f4db08bcfffe34eb54a13","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_5905e5047c84f8fdbb91ce12195f2bcc5463c8680d0f763758a289e787e7a3ac","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=skills-patterns","setting":"c0sogi/llmchat@01f53de6630e snapshot c4528827ac059e0d","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_50025daf90e3a33673f6b73621fc85f395e1b86f8312d690ec9778cfe3aad9a3","slc_6efaefb750134dc9a58bc6c172567713cc6f735c8aa29c082f72ecd9de2d9a4f","slc_bab6f3a15c7043aba0eb42155a2f8fffd8eea1eebfbd129add713719695eff6e","slc_fcfcfbf6b4955098b8644f2a039520e823c259dc0d7b07ae052ec64f1f6fe047"],"source_ids":["src_3b8897c7544e5491ba203ba894e6f210"],"text":"Messages starting with '/' are treated as commands dispatched by a ChatCommands class; /embed stores text in a private Redis vector database, /share stores it publicly, and /query retrieves up to three similar results to ground AI answers.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:39:54Z","updated_by_operation":"op_14b2533f5f5f4db08bcfffe34eb54a13"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:39:54Z","created_by_operation":"op_14b2533f5f5f4db08bcfffe34eb54a13","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_732e3044c865bc4b8c7254cfe000542cccfdfc9b22a23a2e5c75e9a2a1a7653b","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"c0sogi/llmchat@01f53de6630e snapshot c4528827ac059e0d","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_0a2db08f71a14892aedd5526c19b89f2c91de7e1570ae12c3b49eec4250747a4","slc_8fab8abe93f576a9ace317626b24414c48c12f7b5edd2aeecb81d3113b553c44","slc_dda6a118bfd96f4b2adab2bd3dddca8d8aeef8a37748210f551fe313cf10d46c"],"source_ids":["src_3b8897c7544e5491ba203ba894e6f210"],"text":"A MessageManager enforces token limits on message histories via safe add/pop/set methods that update token counts; a ChatLengthException triggers re-limiting via cutoff_message_histories and a resend.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:39:54Z","updated_by_operation":"op_14b2533f5f5f4db08bcfffe34eb54a13"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:39:54Z","created_by_operation":"op_14b2533f5f5f4db08bcfffe34eb54a13","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_7e2c2389ea8f9ffd0f89f1abf6ab5515c7d559bd77377bfbab935b9321321606","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"c0sogi/llmchat@01f53de6630e snapshot c4528827ac059e0d","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_659e19b8a210ff9c5ed440666ba3251e694fbc676e61c8b9a6d2ce2d7cf4d1ec","slc_a81a6d3e2ca4b986097f339f1077c555488e8c7794ade3cee0fece266735987e","slc_b419cbce21c93601a3ad62a7f48f236af61297ae74e8b33a0bd148e3e7dfec39","slc_d5a5b40baf084a3040f49029d876969006fe71464b9be0cd5d62573e3baaf1e4","slc_ef4330726a25e74dc2656cd6f6144c0b824626a546f3bcde6fbb2a6ea8673dfb"],"source_ids":["src_3b8897c7544e5491ba203ba894e6f210"],"text":"Three LLM model types are supported: OpenAIModel (async chat completions via the OpenAI API), LlamaCppModel (local GGML .bin files), and ExllamaModel (local GPTQ model folders), all defined as LLMModel subclasses in app/models/llms.py.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:39:54Z","updated_by_operation":"op_14b2533f5f5f4db08bcfffe34eb54a13"}
